cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the CP-GFM public interface in your work, please cite it as follows."
title: "CP-GFM Public Interface: a topology-aware framework for target-specific cyclic peptide discovery"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-09-06
abstract: >-
  Public scientific interface of CP-GFM, a topology-aware generative and
  runtime decision framework for target-specific cyclic peptide discovery.
  This repository describes the architecture, the public data contracts, and a
  synthetic toy execution. It does not contain the production implementation.
keywords:
  - cyclic peptide
  - generative model
  - multi-objective optimization
  - topology-aware design
  - scientific interface
authors:
